**Pros**: Efficient, stable with concurrent updates
**Cons**: Can't jump to specific page

#### 3. Keyset Pagination
```
GET /api/v1/users?limit=10&lastId=123&lastCreated=2024-01-15

Response:
{
  "data": [ ... ],
  "pagination": {
    "nextParams": {
      "lastId": "456",
      "lastCreated": "2024-01-10"
